---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Conference Talks & Webinars - Datadog - Jason Hand">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="section-hero">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
            <!-- Breadcrumb -->
            <div class="mb-6">
                <a href="/projects" class="text-text-muted hover:text-primary transition-colors">Datadog</a>
                <span class="text-text-muted mx-2">→</span>
                <span class="text-text">Conference Talks & Webinars</span>
            </div>

            <h1 class="mb-8">
                <span class="scattered-letters">
                    <span>C</span><span>o</span><span>n</span><span>f</span><span>e</span><span>r</span><span>e</span><span>n</span><span>c</span><span>e</span>
                </span>
                <br />
                <span class="scattered-letters">
                    <span>T</span><span>a</span><span>l</span><span>k</span><span>s</span>
                </span>
                <br />
                <span class="scattered-letters">
                    <span>&</span>
                </span>
                <br />
                <span class="scattered-letters">
                    <span>W</span><span>e</span><span>b</span><span>i</span><span>n</span><span>a</span><span>r</span><span>s</span>
                </span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                Speaking engagements at major technology conferences and educational webinars with partners, sharing insights on observability, AI, and developer experience.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Overview Section -->
    <section class="section">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center mb-20">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="mb-8 gradient-text">Speaking & Educational Content</h2>
                    <p class="mb-6">
                        I regularly speak at major technology conferences worldwide and host educational webinars with partners like Google, Microsoft, and AWS, 
                        sharing insights on observability, artificial intelligence, and developer experience from my work at Datadog.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mb-6">
                        These sessions cover cutting-edge topics including AI-powered monitoring, modern observability practices, and the future of developer
                        tools. Each presentation aims to educate, inspire, and provide practical insights that attendees can apply in their own organizations.
                    </p>
                    <p>Watch the complete collection of conference talks and webinars in the playlist below.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="relative">
                    <div class="w-full h-96 bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary/20 to-accent/20 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center">
                        <span class="text-6xl gradient-text-secondary">🎤</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Video Playlist Section -->
    <section class="section">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <h2 class="text-center mb-16">
                <span class="scattered-letters">
                    <span>V</span><span>i</span><span>d</span><span>e</span><span>o</span>
                </span>
                <br />
                <span class="scattered-letters">
                    <span>P</span><span>l</span><span>a</span><span>y</span><span>l</span><span>i</span><span>s</span><span>t</span>
                </span>
            </h2>
            <div class="project-card">
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="mb-4 gradient-text text-3xl">Conference Talks & Webinars</h3>
                        <p class="mb-6 text-lg">
                            A collection of recorded conference presentations and educational webinars covering observability, AI, developer tools, 
                            and best practices for modern application monitoring.
                        </p>
                        <div class="mb-6">
                            <h4 class="mb-3 font-semibold gradient-text">Content Includes:</h4>
                            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-text-muted">
                                <li>Conference presentations from Microsoft Build, Google Next, AWS re:Invent, and more</li>
                                <li>Educational webinars with technology partners</li>
                                <li>AI-powered observability and monitoring strategies</li>
                                <li>Developer experience and tooling best practices</li>
                                <li>Modern observability patterns and case studies</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
                            <a 
                                href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLjR8CqndeyMpuZ9CKCvS9yQneHDuSIuMZ" 
                                target="_blank" 
                                rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                                class="btn btn-lg"
                            >
                                Watch Playlist
                            </a>
                            <a 
                                href="https://youtube.com/@jhand" 
                                target="_blank" 
                                rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                                class="btn btn-lg btn-outline"
                            >
                                View Channel
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative">
                        <div class="w-full aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/20 to-secondary/20 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
                            <iframe
                                class="w-full h-full"
                                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLjR8CqndeyMpuZ9CKCvS9yQneHDuSIuMZ"
                                title="Conference Talks & Webinars Playlist"
                                style="border: none;"
                                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen"
                            ></iframe>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Featured Video Section -->
    <section class="section">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <h2 class="text-center mb-16">
                <span class="scattered-letters">
                    <span>F</span><span>e</span><span>a</span><span>t</span><span>u</span><span>r</span><span>e</span><span>d</span>
                </span>
                <br />
                <span class="scattered-letters">
                    <span>T</span><span>a</span><span>l</span><span>k</span>
                </span>
            </h2>
            <div class="project-card border-2 border-accent/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/5 to-primary/5">
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-accent/20 text-accent rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Latest Talk</span>
                            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-primary/20 text-primary rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">November 2025</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="mb-4 gradient-text text-3xl">AI Native Dev Conference</h3>
                        <p class="mb-4 text-text-muted">Virtual Conference • AI Development • Modern Tools</p>
                        <p class="mb-6 text-lg">
                            My latest conference presentation exploring the intersection of AI and developer workflows. This talk dives into how AI-native development practices are transforming how we build, test, and deploy applications.
                        </p>
                        <div class="mb-6">
                            <h4 class="mb-3 font-semibold gradient-text-secondary">Key Topics:</h4>
                            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-text-muted">
                                <li>AI-powered development workflows</li>
                                <li>Modern observability in AI applications</li>
                                <li>Developer productivity tools</li>
                                <li>Best practices for AI integration</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
                            <a href="https://youtu.be/LcsGFQr7vqU" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-lg">
                                Watch on YouTube
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative">
                        <div class="w-full aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/20 to-secondary/20 rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
                            <iframe
                                class="w-full h-full"
                                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/LcsGFQr7vqU"
                                title="AI Native Dev Conference - Jason Hand"
                                style="border: none;"
                                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                                allowfullscreen
                            ></iframe>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Featured Conferences Section -->
    <section class="section">
