                <span class="scattered-letters">
                    <span>T</span><span>o</span><span>p</span><span>i</span><span>c</span><span>s</span>
                </span>
            </h2>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="text-4xl mb-4 gradient-text">🤖</div>
                    <h3 class="mb-4 gradient-text">AI & Machine Learning</h3>
                    <p class="mb-4">Exploring how artificial intelligence is transforming observability, from anomaly detection to predictive analytics.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="project-card">
                    <div class="text-4xl mb-4 gradient-text-secondary">📊</div>
